# L6 counterfactual pool enricher: resolve ONCE at import time. The old call
# site imported on every pipeline run, so a missing module logged an
# ImportError ~50x per boot AND appended a duplicate sys.path entry each time.
# The module's source was never committed to git and is unrecoverable, so it
# stays None (pool widening is covered by the diversity gate below it).
