        # dual-lock (raw=integrator 95%, behavioral=action 84%).
        # l5g-20260818-000053-FIX: post-loop integrator promotion threshold at 0.08.
        # Root cause: break condition (0.10) and post-loop threshold (0.10) are
        # structurally contradictory: the break fires exactly when int_conc < 0.10,
        # so post-loop always finds int_conc < 0.10 and PROMO never fires.
        # With break lowered to 0.08, loop exits when int_conc < 0.08; post-loop
        # threshold 0.08 fires when int_conc >= 0.08 (counterfactual scoring
        # baseline 0.077 + counterfactual boost >= 0.005 reaches 0.082+).
        # l5g-20260817-000130-ROLLBACK guard preserved: _int_press_rk > 0 still
